id: dennis-1969-08-27-multics-pdp7
author: dennis
date: 1969-08-27T17:10:00Z
title: Multics and a smaller system

Bell Labs is stepping away from Multics.
Ken Thompson has been experimenting with a smaller system on a PDP-7.
I’ve started looking at it with him—it’s much simpler,
but there’s something appealing about that simplicity.
We’re thinking about how to build something practical and usable without all the overhead.
